; Room 2 ($02): Under the MegaTree
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: yellow (6). Conveyor: none. Ramp: none.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 0 column 22.
; .
; Exits: left Room 3 (At the Foot of the MegaTree, #R$C300); right Room 1 (The
; Bridge, #R$C100); up Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000); down Room 0 (The Off
; Licence, #R$C000).
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $20 (at $A100) start $10; slot 1: definition
; $2A (at $A150) start $0E; slot 2: definition $1A (at $A0D0) start $1B. List
; ends at slot 3 ($FF).
; .
; Bytes $DF-$E0 hold $80,$A0 (see #R$C000).
@label=RoomUnderMegaTree
